# What no image's recipe copies, kept out of what a build is sent.
#
# Every image is built from the repository root, and each Dockerfile copies
# named manifests and source directories. A builder that sends the whole
# context first would otherwise send what was installed and built here: npm's
# packages, cargo's output and each Python project's environment, which are
# many times the size of the sources.
#
# A path a recipe copies is never listed here. Listing one fails that build at
# its COPY, by the path's name.

.git
.claude
.plans

**/node_modules
**/target
**/.venv
**/dist
**/dist-types
**/coverage

**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache

tests/e2e/test-results
tests/e2e/playwright-report
